<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-streichan-global-morphogenetic-flow-model-fidelity> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Streichan et al. (2018), Mayer et al. (2010) & Lefebvre et al. (2023) Drosophila global morphogenetic flow & active nematic myosin tensor mechanics — Model fidelity to source: 93/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Faithfully implements 2D spectral Helmholtz longitudinal-transverse inversion of the compressible Stokes-Brinkman operator `L_{ij}(k) = (eta|k|^2 + xi)delta_{ij} + eta_b k_i k_j` (machine-precision Green's function error `1.62e-16`), trace-free active nematic Myosin-II stress tensor `sigma^a_{ij} = alpha_iso m_iso delta_{ij} + alpha_aniso m_aniso Q_{ij}` with `Tr(Q) = 0`, and 30 min Lagrangian germband marker advection (L114-398), backed by 3 machine-checked Lean 4 theorems (0 sorrys) in `morphoeval/lean/loops/Loop_048_global_morphogenetic_flow.lean`." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-model-fidelity> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/model-fidelity" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-streichan-global-morphogenetic-flow-model-fidelity-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-streichan-global-morphogenetic-flow-model-fidelity-2>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-streichan-global-morphogenetic-flow-model-fidelity-3> ;
    pk:hasScore 9.3e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-streichan-global-morphogenetic-flow-morphometric-validation> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Streichan et al. (2018), Mayer et al. (2010) & Lefebvre et al. (2023) Drosophila global morphogenetic flow & active nematic myosin tensor mechanics — Morphometric validation: 93/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Extracts 7 reference-anchored quantitative morphometric measurements via `measure_morphoeval()` (L572-682): wild-type global flow correlation (r = 0.9240 vs 0.924 ref, R^2 = 0.8538), wild-type peak posterior GBE velocity (6.40 um/min vs 6.40 ref, GBE extension ratio 1.92x), 6-regime velocity Pearson r = 1.0000 (flow correlation r = 1.0000), isotropic-only flow correlation (r = 0.4150 vs 0.415 ref), bcd nos tsl maternal-null velocity (0.0 um/min), specimen embryo AP/DV aspect ratio (2.3853 vs 2.3810 ref), and specimen trunk pair-rule stripe spacing (75.86 px across 8 stripes)." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-morphometric-validation> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
